  "note": "High-school portion of the Lunenburg Middle-High School roster; the filename slug is 'unknown'. Line 1 holds the two column headings for the blocks starting at line 2, but they are OCR wreckage ('CHUGLILLI', 'varialiall') and are not readable, so that line is ignored and the entries under them carry an empty grade_or_dept rather than a guessed department. Several names are printed with a trailing asterisk, which appears to mark the department head but is not explained anywhere on the page; the asterisk is kept in the name as printed. Column 2 of lines 15 and 24-26 sits after a blank in that column and is not part of the Social Studies / Unified Arts list above it, so grade_or_dept is empty."
